      "description": "The Falconara Marittima Civic Center will revitalize a degraded industrial area in the small coastal town near Ancona. The proposed building balances two volumes, reflecting the social equilibria of everyday life.\n\nOne volume appears visually strong and stable, representing sustainability, while the other is fragile and transparent, signifying social imbalances. Together, they operate dynamically to achieve the appropriate EQUILIBRIUM.\n"
